1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,030
Good morning and thank you for coming here today.

2
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:11,640
I'd like to bring you up to date with changes in the school that will affect your children.

3
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:16,223
As you know, the school buildings date from various times:

4
00:00:16,223 --> 00:00:21,158
some from the 1970s, some from the last five years,

5
00:00:21,739 --> 00:00:25,390
and of course Dartfield House is over a century old

6
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:28,124
It was commissioned by a businessman,

7
00:00:28,124 --> 00:00:32,320
Neville Richards, and intended as his family home

8
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,960
but he died before it was completed.

9
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:40,730
His heir chose to sell it to the local council, who turned it into offices.

10
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:46,495
A later plan to convert it into a tourist information centre didn't come about,

11
00:00:46,495 --> 00:00:52,140
through lack of money, and instead it formed the nucleus of this school

12
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,320
when it opened 40 years ago.

13
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:58,275
The school has grown as the local population has increased,

14
00:00:58,275 --> 00:01:04,138
and I can now give you some news about the lower school site,

15
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:07,370
which is separated from the main site by a road

16
00:01:07,370 --> 00:01:12,450
Planning permission has been granted for development of both sites.

17
00:01:12,450 --> 00:01:19,010
The lower school will move to new buildings that will be constructed on the main site.

18
00:01:19,010 --> 00:01:24,430
Developers will construct houses on the existing lower school site.

19
00:01:24,430 --> 00:01:29,830
Work on the new school buildings should start within the next few months.

20
00:01:29,830 --> 00:01:36,770
A more imminent change concerns the catering facilities and the canteen.

21
00:01:36,770 --> 00:01:40,887
The canteen is always very busy throughout the lunch period -

22
00:01:40,887 --> 00:01:44,820
in fact it's often full to capacity

23
00:01:44,860 --> 00:01:49,120
because a lot of our pupils like the food that's on offer there.

24
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:51,880
But there's only one serving point

25
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:56,530
so most pupils have to wait a considerable time to be served.

26
00:01:56,530 --> 00:02:04,710
This is obviously unsatisfactory, as they may have hardly finished their lunch before afternoon lessons start.

27
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:11,640
So we've had a new Food Hall built, and this will come into use next week.

28
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:14,900
It'll have several serving areas

29
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,108
and I'll give you more details about those in a minute,

30
00:02:17,108 --> 00:02:23,260
but one thing we ask you to do, to help in the smooth running of the Food Hall,

31
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:26,680
is to discuss with your children each morning

32
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:29,412
which type of food they want to eat that day,

33
00:02:29,412 --> 00:02:32,830
so they can go straight to the relevant serving point.

34
00:02:32,830 --> 00:02:37,815
There won't be any junk food - everything on offer will be healthy -

35
00:02:37,815 --> 00:02:46,540
and there's no change to the current system of paying for lunches by topping up your child's electronic payment card online.

36
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:52,000
You may be wondering what will happen to the old canteen.

37
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,602
We'll still have tables and chairs in there,

38
00:02:54,602 --> 00:02:59,480
and pupils can eat food from the Food Hall or lunch they've brought from home.

39
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:04,880
Eventually we may use part of the canteen for storage,

40
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:11,360
but first we'll see how many pupils go in there at lunchtime.

41
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:15,848
OK, back to the serving points in the Food Hall,

42
00:03:15,848 --> 00:03:18,320
which will all have side dishes

43
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:23,030
desserts and drinks on sale, as well as main courses.

44
00:03:23,030 --> 00:03:27,500
One serving point we call World Adventures.

45
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:31,940
This will serve a different country's cuisine each day

46
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:36,050
maybe Chinese one day and Lebanese the next.

47
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:39,940
The menus will be planned for a week at a time,

48
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:44,890
so pupils will know what's going to be available the whole of that week.

49
00:03:44,890 --> 00:03:52,230
Street Life is also international, with food from three particular cultures.

50
00:03:52,230 --> 00:03:55,580
We'll ask pupils to make suggestions

51
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:58,831
so perhaps sometimes there'll be food from Thailand,

52
00:03:58,831 --> 00:04:07,790
Ethiopia and Mexico, and then one of them will be replaced by Jamaican food for a week or two.

53
00:04:07,790 --> 00:04:14,800
The Speedy Italian serving point will cater particularly for the many pupils

54
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,620
who don't eat meat or fish:

55
00:04:15,620 --> 00:04:21,710
they can be sure that all the food served there is suitable for them.

56
00:04:21,710 --> 00:04:27,380
There'll be plenty of variety, so they shouldn't get bored with the food.

57
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:31,240
OK, that's all on the new Food Hall.

58
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:34,650
Now after-school lessons.

59
00:04:34,650 --> 00:04:37,200
These are very popular with pupils

60
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:42,110
particularly swimming - in fact there's a waiting list for lessons.

61
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:52,650
Cycling is another favourite, and I'm delighted that dozens of pupils make use of the chance to learn to ride in off-road conditions.

62
00:04:52,650 --> 00:04:56,800
It means that more and more cycle to and from school every day.

63
00:04:56,800 --> 00:05:01,000
As you know, we have a well-equipped performance centre

64
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:04,500
and we're going to start drama classes in there, too.

65
00:05:04,500 --> 00:05:10,894
Pupils will be able to join in just for fun or work up to taking part in a play -

66
00:05:10,894 --> 00:05:14,260
we hope to put on at least one a year.

67
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:18,480
We already teach a number of pupils to use the sound

68
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:20,600
and lighting systems in the centre.

69
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:25,280
And a former pupil has given a magnificent grand piano to the school,

70
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:32,120
so a few pupils will be able to learn at the school instead of going to the local college,

71
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:35,000
as many of them do at the moment.
